     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "What options are there for locking the drawers of the »toolOrganizer«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The drawers can be locked either electronically or mechanically. There is also the option of using the »smartCompartment« to lock individual compartments.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c2836",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Can the division within a drawer in the »toolOrganizer« or a pull-out in the »keeper« be freely defined?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The contents can be freely defined. The »toolOrganizer« has drawer dividers, the »smartCompartment«, to divide your drawers optimally. With the »keeper«, the heights of the individual levels can be adjusted and fitted with the appropriate tool holders from ZOLLER Tooling Solutions.</p> <p>Your ZOLLER sales contact will be happy to advise you.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/company/contact-us\"><strong>Request a ZOLLER sales inquiry</strong></a></p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c2834",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Can the Smart Cabinets also be controlled from the network?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Yes, these can also be controlled via the network.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c2820",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Which ZOLLER TMS Tool Management Solutions software do I need to control the Smart Cabinets?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>ZOLLER TMS Tool Management is not necessary to operate the Smart Cabinets. You can get started quickly and easily with a basic package for the Smart Cabinets and conveniently book additional modules or packages (BRONZE, SILVER or GOLD) at a later date.</p> <p>More about ZOLLER TMS</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c2818",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
